 "doors_rule": {
  "NOMINATED": "R16: nominated by ANY seat at ANY conviction. ADMITTED UNCONDITIONALLY -- never cut, never ordered against a machine find, never subject to the cap.",
  "HELD": "R16 + R12: a position the PM owns. On the floor unconditionally, so the ADD question is asked and not only the keep/exit question.",
